        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="There’s">There’s</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="There are">There are</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="There isn’t">There isn’t</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Are there">Are there</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="There is">There is</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="It’s">It’s</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>The guide introduces one elevator: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="There’s" data-hint="Listen for one elevator being introduced for the first time." data-fix="There's an elevator beside reception." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button> an elevator beside reception.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>The guide introduces two restrooms: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="There are" data-hint="Listen for the plural noun two restrooms." data-fix="There are two restrooms on this floor." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button> two restrooms on this floor.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The kitchen update introduces an uncountable amount: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="There is" data-hint="Coffee is an uncountable amount here, so use the singular form is." data-fix="There is some coffee in the kitchen." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button> some coffee in the kitchen.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>The visitor asks about plural facilities: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="Are there" data-hint="Listen for the plural noun any outlets and question order." data-fix="Are there any outlets near this table?" data-placeholder="listen">listen</button> any outlets near this table?</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>The notice reports that one service is unavailable: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="There isn’t" data-hint="Listen for one shuttle and the negative meaning unavailable today." data-fix="There isn't a shuttle today." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button> a shuttle today.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>The speaker already introduced the elevator and now locates that known elevator: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="It’s" data-hint="The elevator is already known, so the speaker now refers back to it with it." data-fix="It's beside reception." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button> beside reception.</span></div>
