    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>The kitchen note introduces an uncountable amount: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="There’s" data-hint="Coffee is uncountable here, so use the singular chunk There's." data-fix="There's some coffee in the kitchen." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> some coffee in the kitchen.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>The area guide introduces many restaurants: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="There are" data-hint="Many restaurants is plural, so use There are." data-fix="There are many restaurants near my office." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> many restaurants near my office.</span></div>
