    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>The line counter shows four people: There <input class="answer-input" data-answer="are" data-hint="Four people is plural, so use are." data-fix="There are four people in line." aria-label="Verb after there before plural four people in line" /> four people in line.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The directory confirms that no bank is available here: There <input class="answer-input" data-answer="isn’t" data-hint="A bank is singular, and the directory gives a negative result." data-fix="There isn't a bank here." aria-label="Negative verb after there before singular a bank here" /> a bank here.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>The host says all the tables are occupied: There <input class="answer-input" data-answer="aren’t" data-hint="Tables is plural, and all occupied means no free tables remain." data-fix="There aren't any free tables." aria-label="Negative verb after there before plural any free tables" /> any free tables.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>A visitor asks about one restroom: <input class="answer-input" data-answer="Is" data-hint="A restroom is singular; move Is before there and capitalize it." data-fix="Is there a restroom on this floor?" aria-label="Question starter before there a restroom on this floor" /> there a restroom on this floor?</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>A customer asks about plural seats: <input class="answer-input" data-answer="Are" data-hint="Seats is plural; move Are before there and capitalize it." data-fix="Are there any seats near the window?" aria-label="Question starter before there any seats near the window" /> there any seats near the window?</span></div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-answers>Check</button>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-answers>Reset</button>
    </div>
    <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <h2>Read and choose</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>An apartment listing</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">"Bright one-bedroom apartment on Alder Street. There’s a modern kitchen and a large closet in the bedroom. There are two big windows in the living room. There isn’t a parking space, but there’s a bus stop across the street. Sorry, no pets: there aren’t any animals in the building."</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You located the apartment's two windows, missing parking space, and bus stop from explicit details in the listing.">
    <h3>Drill 3: read, then choose</h3>
